        'atLongestPpm is atLongestMs expressed in ppm',
        ha2.stability && Math.abs(ha2.stability.atLongestPpm - ha2.stability.atLongestMs * 1000) < 1e-9,
        'ppm=' + (ha2.stability && ha2.stability.atLongestPpm)
